    },
    {
      "id": "rel-fed-from-to",
      "from": "Concept",
      "predicate": "federates",
      "to": "Concept",
      "via": "Federation Edge",
      "normative": true
    }
  ],
  "rules": [
    "Semantic Control Plane is the only SoR for enterprise meaning (concepts, namespaces, mappings, federation).",
    "Collibra Guided Stewardship semantic layer (Data Model/Entity/Attribute) is NOT this pack \u2014 see Business Catalog.",
    "Technical Catalog and Business Catalog assets are SOURCES of Mapping Records; Concepts are TARGETS.",
